{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_932.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"a299c1cd12577bb3702ffc220cfc06e89e138ed45f2819196f55a37238196b26","ja":"ここまでとは思ってなかったわ……。\nなんだか、吸い込まれそう……。","zh":"没想到会变成这样……。\n总觉得好像要被吸进去……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_932.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0dc0363e4b44248c64439bf4112d7b7c6651a09e41d7b875e8fb96855c5ccefa","ja":"うん、すごい……。\nいつまでも見ていられそう……。","zh":"嗯，好厉害……。\n感觉可以一直看下去……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_932.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"bc8984b2b06198f6b787cbf7934411add0a1af8515e69f6de7e7f3bf6dd2e26b","ja":"私も、私も近くで見たいです！","zh":"我也想近距离看看！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_932.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"862c956dc615d9d401a1ab90b0198d238b224093b77702ac06a0eb6c8fe46406","ja":"わぁ～……すっごく大きい！\n……いくらくらいするんだろ……？","zh":"哇～……好大啊！\n……大概多少钱呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_932.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"c45371843e41ae22df335bf7f00f23ca7408c7427295c0f488390ba06f0f1fdd","ja":"これがダイヤモンドの輝き……。\nむ～ん、シンプルに見えて奥深いですな～。","zh":"这就是钻石的光辉……。\n唔～嗯，看似简单，实则深奥啊～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_932.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"6360a446e9b8cf8b31305427463b83e02248d9c9557c71ad2c737486d375cb68","ja":"ええ、不思議……思わず見惚れちゃったもの。\nさすがは世界最大級ね。","zh":"是啊，真是不可思议……我不由自主地看入迷了。\n不愧是世界最大级别的呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_932.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"6d6cb4c6b4a93dba68be962ddd09be97261a2fe716568a677e97b7dc53261c1e","ja":"はい！　今日見たなかで、\n2番目にすごいって思いました！","zh":"是的！在今天见过的里面，\n我觉得是第2厉害的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_932.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"904c4d9709b27e2f3d5a92a3b6a3f2062a893e3c4506cd3b80a86fc9d4bec1a1","ja":"2番？　今回の展示では、このダイヤが\n一番大きな宝石のはずだけど……。","zh":"2号？这次展览中，这颗钻石应该\n是最大的宝石，可是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_932.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"38f6bc0e65367330a8b03fca6632517515efc28e7b733650e5f5d18d31fd3ed7","ja":"私の一番は、さっき見た赤いネックレスです！\r\nすっごく、かわいかったので……♪","zh":"我的最爱是刚才看到的红色项链！因为超级可爱……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_932.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"2dfc5c955f0d620cb6c9c54d8ad63a15f5f34826d3f2772a105e7a7d06d871ad","ja":"私は、ちょうちょのブローチが一等賞ですな～。","zh":"我的蝴蝶胸针得了一等奖呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_932.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"abe6f1ea273aa73a338a7a7007b96f9787bd560e057d75e315097a32a836d3a5","ja":"そう……そうだったわね。一番の見どころが、\r\n必ずみんなの一番になるとは限らないものね。","zh":"是啊……说得对。最精彩的部分，不一定能成为大家心中的最精彩。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_932.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"259a88526da6195c48552e720b97d6c7fd3c680c499ca3f5a7787544a0d6d0bd","ja":"まだ時間はあるし……ふたりとも、もう1周しない？\r\n私も、自分の一番を見つけたくなっちゃった。ふふっ♪","zh":"还有时间……你们两个，不再跑1圈吗？我也想找到自己的最佳状态了。呵呵♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
